page 2 80x24 fill spaces
|                                                                                |
|    V E L O U R      Texts                                                      |
|    ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── ■            |
|                                                                                |
|    ■  Texts  ∙  Velour                                                         |
|                                                                                |
|    3 min read                                                                  |
|                                                                                |
|    The terminal size is from 20 to 255 columns and from 10 to 100              |
|    rows. A new terminal size takes effect at the next screen.                  |
|                                                                                |
|    Screens                                                                     |
|                                                                                |
|    Screens are text files of the sysop in the BBT format. A file               |
|    has text, styles, fields and conditions. One screen can have                |
|    different forms for a narrow and a wide terminal.                           |
|                                                                                |
|    A theme gives the styles, and each colour depth can have its                |
|    own. Velour replaces a colour that the terminal does not have               |
|    with the nearest one.                                                       |
|                                                                                |
|    ───────────────────────────   2/6   ────────────────────────────            |
|    B Back    Space Next                                 Esc To list            |
|                                                                                |
