|                                                                                |
|    V E L O U R      Texts                                                      |
|    ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── ■            |
|                                                                                |
|    ■  Texts  ∙  Velour                                                         |
|                                                                                |
|    3 min read                                                                  |
|                                                                                |
|    Fields show the data of the session and of the station: the                 |
|    address of the guest, the time online, the BBS name, the Velour             |
|    version, the open sessions, the server time and the uptime. The             |
|    sysop sets the form and the time zone of the server time.                   |
|                                                                                |
|    Menus                                                                       |
|                                                                                |
|    Hotkeys lead from screen to screen. Letters also work in the                |
|    Russian layout: й is q. A menu item can work only under a                   |
|    condition. A submenu goes back to the screen that opened it: its            |
|    back item does not name that screen.                                        |
|                                                                                |
|                                                                                |
|    ───────────────────────────   3/6   ────────────────────────────            |
|    B Back    Space Next                                 Esc To list            |
|                                                                                |
