|                                                                                |
|    V E L O U R      Texts                                                      |
|    ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── ■            |
|                                                                                |
|    ■  Texts  ∙  Velour                                                         |
|                                                                                |
|    3 min read                                                                  |
|                                                                                |
|    Texts                                                                       |
|                                                                                |
|    A file screen shows Markdown, plain text or source code in                  |
|    pages. Markdown has headings, lists, quotes, code, tables and               |
|    links with notes. Velour counts the reading time.                           |
|                                                                                |
|    One screen shows many files: a menu item gives it the file. A               |
|    file screen can show a part of a source file and line numbers.              |
|                                                                                |
|    Art                                                                         |
|                                                                                |
|    velourbbs art import converts ANSI art from Moebius, icy_draw               |
|    and PabloDraw to the Velour format. A screen inserts art between            |
|    ───────────────────────────   4/6   ────────────────────────────            |
|    B Back    Space Next                                 Esc To list            |
|                                                                                |
