|    V E L O U R      Texts                                                      |
|    ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── ■            |
|                                                                                |
|    ■  Texts  ∙  Velour                                                         |
|                                                                                |
|    3 min read                                                                  |
|                                                                                |
|    its text.                                                                   |
|                                                                                |
|    For the sysop                                                               |
|                                                                                |
|    velourbbs check finds the errors in the screen files and gives              |
|    the file, the line and the column. velourbbs preview shows a                |
|    screen without a connection: at any terminal size, at any colour            |
|    depth and after key presses.                                                |
|                                                                                |
|    The station limits the connections: in total, and from one                  |
|    address both the open ones and the new ones per minute. Velour              |
|    takes the address of the guest from a proxy with the PROXY                  |
|    protocol.                                                                   |
